---

Additional note: this software modifies the firmware of a physical device
(a SkyTC KMP510 / Ingenic JZ4760B based internet radio) by replacing a
system binary via a bind mount and by editing the device's boot script.
Applying it carries a real risk of misconfiguration or, in the worst case,
of rendering the device unusable. Use it entirely at your own risk - see
the disclaimer at the top of README.md for details. This license's
standard "no warranty" language above already covers this, but it's
spelled out here again because it matters more than it does for a typical
piece of software.
